# The Expert two-stream route of Obsidian Keep in co-op (designer DB3; P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S; recorded from
# closed-loop duo macros, build/db3/bot_w4_l2_coop.gd). Both cross the lava pits and the gatehouse column one
# after the other; in the great hall P1 holds plate pa under the slabs while P2 walks the lower corridor to plate
# pb behind the wall, then P1 climbs the slabs through the upper corridor (gate 'plates'); both climb the column
# staircase one column apart, waiting out each column's quake; on the rampart P2 Shoulder-Hops off P1's head onto
# the keep tower for Cave Painting 28; P1 waits at drum B by the tower while P2 jumps the spike well and climbs
# onto the drum ledge: both strike on the count of three and the portcullis rises for good (gate 'drums'); both
# reach the exit (the team exit). Club only, no S; nobody stands 243 ticks without input.
